From be4d8d27b15cc5c5fa77d094902d0107be8469d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sukrit Jaidee <45908411+SukritJaAIproject@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 10:45:39 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 32/34] fix(desktop): review fixes for the 1.7.0 dataset,
 ground-truth and training work

Security
- Per-launch API token: Electron generates 32 random bytes, passes them to the
  sidecar (IMPS_API_TOKEN, removed from its environment) and to the dashboard;
  every route but GET /health requires X-iMPS-Token. desktop-api.json in
  %APPDATA% gives local tooling the port and token.
- ZIP import reads only STORED/DEFLATE entries (BZIP2/LZMA expand unbounded in
  CPython), checks the ratio of every entry over 64 KiB, and bounds the entry
  count and central directory from the end record before zipfile parses it.

Dataset service (rewritten)
- Every import listed (no 24 cap), unreadable manifests counted.
- failed status: empty completes and interrupted uploads (marked at startup,
  temp files swept, orphaned captures removed); discard route for unfinished
  batches; damaged entries skipped without losing the archive.
- Per-import locks, manifest and label caches, throttled manifest writes,
  free-space checks; unreadable labels count as unreviewed and are moved aside
  on relabel instead of breaking every tab.

Training
- engine.json (CLI > env > file > workstation default) with a requirement list
  in health; preview route with captures shared between batches counted once.
- Worker samples capped windows uniformly (seeded reservoir, content order)
  and reports contributing captures/sessions; per-capture telemetry deleted
  as it goes, work/ removed after each run and at startup; progress writes
  retried and never fatal.

Runtime
- Every route answers JSON on any error; an unusable dataset/training store
  disables only those routes (503 + reason, reported in /health).

UI
- Dataset panel stays mounted across tabs, Finish/Discard for unfinished
  batches, folder import skips bad files, no "automatic" retrain wording,
  Gregorian Thai dates. Ground Truth has no pre-selected decision, a real
  error state and accessible controls. Train Model shows requirements, the
  settings file and server-side counts.
- Station Health weights ISOLATION_FAULT as a safety fault; a connector needs
  20 sessions to be the hotspot.

Tests: 55 Python (crafted archives, recovery, discard, HTTP token, worker
sampling) now run in desktop:prepare; vitest adds token and helper tests.

